# This dependency-free example needs no configuration and no API keys — the demo
# and tests run on the standard library alone. This file is a placeholder for a
# production evaluation practice that traces and evaluates against a live system:
#
# FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=<your-foundry-project-endpoint>
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=<your-otel-collector-endpoint>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in only if you wire in live tracing/evaluation.
# Never commit the .env file itself.
